b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">45</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">46</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 47\">47</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 48\">48</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">49</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 50\">50</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017162334\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 300/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3464/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 236/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion